(6801718, 1022645, 113412, '<td valign="top">Stunningly simple. I especially like the sharp focused green against the black, and the soft green bokeh behind.</td>', 'Stunningly simple. I especially like the sharp focused green against the black, and the soft green bokeh behind.', '2012-06-25 12:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801725, 1022581, 113412, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning reflection. The cool blues and the hot oranges play together so well. The ripples in the water add a perfect texture.</td>', 'This is a stunning reflection. The cool blues and the hot oranges play together so well. The ripples in the water add a perfect texture.', '2012-06-25 12:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801726, 1022544, 113412, '<td valign="top">Nice post-processing on this. I like the muted colors and the intense grain.</td>', 'Nice post-processing on this. I like the muted colors and the intense grain.', '2012-06-25 12:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801727, 1022513, 113412, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a beautiful Asian water color. Nice work.</td>', 'This reminds me of a beautiful Asian water color. Nice work.', '2012-06-25 12:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801756, 1022748, 118154, '<td valign="top">I am liking this very much.</td>', 'I am liking this very much.', '2012-06-25 13:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801757, 1022513, 118154, '<td valign="top">Has to be up there somewhere,my fav so far.</td>', 'Has to be up there somewhere,my fav so far.', '2012-06-25 13:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801760, 1022518, 118154, '<td valign="top">That''s nice.8.</td>', 'That''s nice.8.', '2012-06-25 13:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801766, 1021979, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not much of an abstract in my opinion.  But I guess the argument could be made.</td>', 'Not much of an abstract in my opinion.  But I guess the argument could be made.', '2012-06-25 13:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801767, 1022721, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but I''m not sure about the coloring, is that natural?  The ball of grasses on the far right seem to mess up the concept.</td>', 'I like the image, but I''m not sure about the coloring, is that natural?  The ball of grasses on the far right seem to mess up the concept.', '2012-06-25 13:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801769, 1022656, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like it!  But I think the near-horizon crop muddies the concept some.  Crop off the top inch and I think you''ve got something even better.</td>', 'I like it!  But I think the near-horizon crop muddies the concept some.  Crop off the top inch and I think you''ve got something even better.', '2012-06-25 13:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801770, 1022709, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting composition.  Feels like quite the abstract painting.</td>', 'I like the interesting composition.  Feels like quite the abstract painting.', '2012-06-25 13:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801772, 1022158, 142473, '<td valign="top">The subject seems a little too obvious and monotonous for my tastes in an abstract.</td>', 'The subject seems a little too obvious and monotonous for my tastes in an abstract.', '2012-06-25 13:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801774, 1022831, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting impressionist image.  I''m not normally a fan of negatives, but this works.</td>', 'Interesting impressionist image.  I''m not normally a fan of negatives, but this works.', '2012-06-25 13:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801775, 1022505, 142473, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Although the composition is a bit too centered in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice!  Although the composition is a bit too centered in my opinion.', '2012-06-25 13:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801777, 1022814, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice movement.  Combined with the interesting swirl and exceptional lighting make this quite interesting.</td>', 'Nice movement.  Combined with the interesting swirl and exceptional lighting make this quite interesting.', '2012-06-25 13:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801779, 1022672, 142473, '<td valign="top">Looks like a reflection of someone''s memory of a perfect day.  Some of the details are lost, and replaced by the cob webbs of the brain, but most of it is still there.</td>', 'Looks like a reflection of someone''s memory of a perfect day.  Some of the details are lost, and replaced by the cob webbs of the brain, but most of it is still there.', '2012-06-25 13:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801780, 1022746, 142473, '<td valign="top">My initial impression is that this is quite a pretty and intricate flower.  But I''m not sure that means it''s an especially good abstract.  To me, an abstract needs a little more ambiguity, so as to force the viewer into thinking more.</td>', 'My initial impression is that this is quite a pretty and intricate flower.  But I''m not sure that means it''s an especially good abstract.  To me, an abstract needs a little more ambiguity, so as to force the viewer into thinking more.', '2012-06-25 13:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801785, 1022602, 142473, '<td valign="top">Although I can almost immediately understand what this is, the literal interpretation is not emphasized, and it''s easy for the viewer to craft their own connotation.</td>', 'Although I can almost immediately understand what this is, the literal interpretation is not emphasized, and it''s easy for the viewer to craft their own connotation.', '2012-06-25 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801786, 1022692, 142473, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed the hunt.  I like the somewhat unique composition, but to me the subject is a bit too literal.</td>', 'I enjoyed the hunt.  I like the somewhat unique composition, but to me the subject is a bit too literal.', '2012-06-25 13:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801788, 1022544, 142473, '<td valign="top">Magnetic.  I find my eyes trailing into the upper left blue area from time to time... and I keep wondering where the texture came from in that area.  It''s rather interesting.  Possibly made from camera noise?  But the blue hue, combined with the sandiness of the natural wood color makes this image to me.  The details are good, but they wouldn''t stand alone.</td>', 'Magnetic.  I find my eyes trailing into the upper left blue area from time to time... and I keep wondering where the texture came from in that area.  It''s rather interesting.  Possibly made from camera noise?  But the blue hue, combined with the sandiness of the natural wood color makes this image to me.  The details are good, but they wouldn''t stand alone.', '2012-06-25 13:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801789, 1022645, 142473, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is not a found image.  All the same, it''s got quite the interesting comp.  The lighting is nice, as it mimics the blades, but not exactly.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is not a found image.  All the same, it''s got quite the interesting comp.  The lighting is nice, as it mimics the blades, but not exactly.', '2012-06-25 13:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801791, 1022679, 142473, '<td valign="top">A wonderful abstract, but ruined by the choice not to use the whole light-dark spectrum.  I enjoy images that rebel, but this one just takes away in my opinion.  I''d love to see this processed to fill the whole histogram.</td>', 'A wonderful abstract, but ruined by the choice not to use the whole light-dark spectrum.  I enjoy images that rebel, but this one just takes away in my opinion.  I''d love to see this processed to fill the whole histogram.', '2012-06-25 13:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801792, 1022687, 142473, '<td valign="top">Quite a good composition.  All points are essentially leading into the image, and the dark corners further emphasize the centered nature of this image.  Great details too, and although the subject is easily understood - it retains a nice abstract quality.</td>', 'Quite a good composition.  All points are essentially leading into the image, and the dark corners further emphasize the centered nature of this image.  Great details too, and although the subject is easily understood - it retains a nice abstract quality.', '2012-06-25 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801793, 1022797, 142473, '<td valign="top">Explosion of color.  It''s a blurry mess, but you were able to retain some of the details all the same.  Really nice, although I think a little more blur of the background would have been a benefit to the focus of the image.</td>', 'Explosion of color.  It''s a blurry mess, but you were able to retain some of the details all the same.  Really nice, although I think a little more blur of the background would have been a benefit to the focus of the image.', '2012-06-25 14:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801796, 1022677, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I would have liked some extra processing to potentially put further emphasis on the curves of the wood.  Personally, I think you might have included too much wood.  If I visually crop vertically down the center, the left OR right side individually carry more visual interest than the entire image by itself.</td>', 'Not bad.  I would have liked some extra processing to potentially put further emphasis on the curves of the wood.  Personally, I think you might have included too much wood.  If I visually crop vertically down the center, the left OR right side individually carry more visual interest than the entire image by itself.', '2012-06-25 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801797, 1022711, 142473, '<td valign="top">Vast emptiness.  I like it, but I think the minimal element needs a bit more boldness in an image like this.</td>', 'Vast emptiness.  I like it, but I think the minimal element needs a bit more boldness in an image like this.', '2012-06-25 14:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801798, 1022000, 142473, '<td valign="top">Quite a good sunset, but maybe a bit expected?</td>', 'Quite a good sunset, but maybe a bit expected?', '2012-06-25 14:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801800, 1021687, 142473, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think a little more separation of tones could have helped.  It comes across a bit flat.  An offset light source might have worked better here, in my opinion.</td>', 'Personally, I think a little more separation of tones could have helped.  It comes across a bit flat.  An offset light source might have worked better here, in my opinion.', '2012-06-25 14:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801801, 1022529, 142473, '<td valign="top">Quite exquisite.  I''m guessing it''s the underside of a mushroom.  Genius.  Perfectly processed.</td>', 'Quite exquisite.  I''m guessing it''s the underside of a mushroom.  Genius.  Perfectly processed.', '2012-06-25 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801802, 1022616, 142473, '<td valign="top">A bit too centered maybe... but overall I really like it.  I''m not normally a fan of negatives, but this one works very well to draw the viewer in.  I almost didn''t realize it was a negative.</td>', 'A bit too centered maybe... but overall I really like it.  I''m not normally a fan of negatives, but this one works very well to draw the viewer in.  I almost didn''t realize it was a negative.', '2012-06-25 14:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801804, 1022653, 142473, '<td valign="top">Looks like it must be a part of a much larger image, that was cropped down for this tiny part?  I like it, except for the extreme pixelation of the edges.  If it was smoothed out, I could see this doing very well.</td>', 'Looks like it must be a part of a much larger image, that was cropped down for this tiny part?  I like it, except for the extreme pixelation of the edges.  If it was smoothed out, I could see this doing very well.', '2012-06-25 14:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801805, 1022610, 142473, '<td valign="top">Quite enjoyable.  Masterful composition.</td>', 'Quite enjoyable.  Masterful composition.', '2012-06-25 14:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
