(6802391, 1022513, 7778, '<td valign="top">The rustling of silk is discontinued,<br/>dust drifts over the courtyard,<br/>There is no sound of foot-fall, and the leaves<br/>scurry into heaps and lie still,<br/>And she the rejoicer of the heart is beneath them:<br/> <br/>A wet leaf clings to the threshold.<br/> <br/>The petals fall in the fountain,<br/>the orange-coloured rose-leaves,<br/>Their ochre clings to the stone.<br/> <br/>-from LIU CH''E and TS''AI CH''IH by Ezra Pound</td>', 'The rustling of silk is discontinued,dust drifts over the courtyard,There is no sound of foot-fall, and the leavesscurry into heaps and lie still,And she the rejoicer of the heart is beneath them: A wet leaf clings to the threshold. The petals fall in the fountain,the orange-coloured rose-leaves,Their ochre clings to the stone. -from LIU CH''E and TS''AI CH''IH by Ezra Pound', '2012-06-26 17:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
