(6802997, 1022575, 66267, '<td valign="top">i think the point of this challenge was to show how natural features could create abstraction. this is an abstract shot, yes, and it may be of a natural feature, but it''s impossible to tell; it could be pretty much anything. i think the highest scorers will have subjects that are perfectly clear and distinguishable, but are shot from a unique perspective that illustrated their abstract qualities.</td>', 'i think the point of this challenge was to show how natural features could create abstraction. this is an abstract shot, yes, and it may be of a natural feature, but it''s impossible to tell; it could be pretty much anything. i think the highest scorers will have subjects that are perfectly clear and distinguishable, but are shot from a unique perspective that illustrated their abstract qualities.', '2012-06-27 12:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
