(6806553, 1022529, 144271, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your kind comments.  I am so excited to get my first ribbon.  It is awesome!  Last Monday  I was so happy just to have an entry in the 7 area and now to win a ribbon is great.  I entered this one at the last minute after looking at all the mushrooms in my yard from all the rain.  I thought the bottoms were very abstract.  I never thought it would do this well.  Thanks again.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your kind comments.  I am so excited to get my first ribbon.  It is awesome!  Last Monday  I was so happy just to have an entry in the 7 area and now to win a ribbon is great.  I entered this one at the last minute after looking at all the mushrooms in my yard from all the rain.  I thought the bottoms were very abstract.  I never thought it would do this well.  Thanks again.', '2012-07-02 12:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
